es are 0 across the dataset), and therefore, it contributes no information for predictions.\n```end\n\n```python\n# Explanation why the column Soil_Type14 is dropped\ndf.drop(columns=['Soil_Type14'], inplace=True)\n# Soil_Type14 has zero variance (all values are 0 across the dataset), so it has no predictive power and can be safely removed.\n```end\n\n```python\n# Explanation why the column Soil_Type36 is dropped\ndf.drop(columns=['Soil_Type36'], inplace=True)\n# Soil_Type36 has near-zero variance (Mean = 0.0001, Std = 0.0095), indicating minimal contribution to model performance.\n```end"]
